      "",
      "**Net stance: still Constructive, but with one less major risk to worry about (the geopolitical one is materially de-risking) and one more confirmed concern (multiple compression on muted post-print reactions).** The book positioning is still right; the conviction on the USO short and the avoid-extended-multiples discipline both strengthen.",
