    "1810":{ en: "At HKD ~31-32 (multi-agent debate): Bull HKD 56-58 (+76-82%, PEG 0.44 anomaly, EV momentum inflecting +50% April YoY, P/S 1.71x = get EV+AIoT free); Bear HKD 24-26 (-10 to -17%, China EV price war structurally compressing margins, smartphone +25% is low-base recovery, -48% drawdown = institutional distribution). Neutral: 'Zero China = starter is diversification not concentration. If you can only pick one and want asymmetry, this is the asymmetry trade. If you want sleep, it isn't.' **For user $2k question: Xiaomi is the cleanest deployment of the 4 options** — no binary catalyst pending (vs TCEHY 5/20, PDD 5/22), price-fundamentals divergence is real, fills 0% China gap. **Holding period must be 24+ months**. Tranche 1 HKD 30-33 here (50% position), Tranche 2 HKD 25-28 (remaining 50%). Stop HKD 24.",
             zh: "HKD ~31-32（多 agent 辩论）：Bull HKD 56-58（+76-82%、PEG 0.44 异常、EV 动量加速 4 月 +50% YoY、P/S 1.71x = 免费获 EV+AIoT）；Bear HKD 24-26（−10 至 −17%、中国 EV 价格战结构性压缩利润率、手机 +25% 是低基数恢复、−48% 回撤 = 机构分销）。**Neutral**：「0% 中国敞口 = 起仓是多元化、非集中。若只能选一个且要不对称、这就是不对称交易。若要睡得着、就不是」。**对你 $2k 问题：小米是 4 个选项中最干净的部署**——无待清算二元催化（vs TCEHY 5/20、PDD 5/22）、价格-基本面分化真实、填 0% 中国缺口。**持有时间必须 24+ 个月**。第一笔 HKD 30-33 此处（50% 仓位）、第二笔 HKD 25-28（剩 50%）。止损 HKD 24。" },
    PDD:   { en: "At deep value zone (multi-agent debate): Bull $155 (+45%, mean-reversion 8x→12x P/E alone gets 50%, Pinduoduo 600M+ moat intact, Temu adapting via local fulfillment); Bear $75-85 (-25 to -35%, revenue collapse +90%→+10% in 2 years = structural break, Q3 net profit -15% YoY, Temu directly exposed to tariff escalation). Neutral: 'Cheap for a reason — market doesn't believe the E. Deep value with structural overhang pre-binary print is coin flip with fat tails. PDD is the only one with a known landmine in 11 days.' **For user $2k ranking: Xiaomi > TCEHY > ORCL >> PDD. SKIP PDD pre-print.** Don't catch falling knife 11 days before binary where Temu guidance could halve overnight. Post-5/22 entry only if 3 checks pass.",
             zh: "深度价值区（多 agent 辩论）：Bull $155（+45%、单纯均值回归 8x→12x P/E 即 50%、拼多多 6 亿+ 护城河完整、Temu 本地履约调整）；Bear $75-85（−25 至 −35%、收入崩塌 +90%→+10% 两年 = 结构性破坏、Q3 净利 YoY −15%、Temu 直接暴露于关税升级）。**Neutral**：「便宜是有原因的——市场不相信 E。深度价值 + 结构性悬空 + 二元财报前 = 厚尾抛硬币。PDD 是 11 天内唯一有已知地雷的」。**对你 $2k 排名：小米 > TCEHY > ORCL >> PDD。SKIP PDD 财报前**。不要在 Temu 指引一夜砍半的二元前 11 天接落刀。仅 5/22 后若 3 项检验通过入场。" }
